  2→//!
  3→//! Platform-agnostic data structures (InodeTable, MetadataCache, ContentCache,
  4→//! FileHandle) are shared across all platforms. Platform-specific mount/unmount
  5→//! and FUSE callback implementations are behind feature flags.
